    "placeholder": "Enter your reflection here.",
    "long_instructions": "A program stores these 16 bits:\r\n\r\n```1001011000000110```\r\n\r\nThese bits describe a black and white image that is 4 pixels wide and 4 pixels tall. Each bit is one pixel (0 = black, 1 = white), read row by row starting at the top left. Write out the four rows, or describe the picture.\r\n\r\nSuppose a friend sent you only these 16 bits and nothing else. \r\n\r\nExplain why you might draw a different picture than your friend intended.",
